l improvement in patients with decompensated liver disease caused by hepatitis B after treatment with lamivudine</article-title><source>Liver Transpl</source><year>2000</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>715</fpage><lpage>720</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11084057</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1053/jlts.2000.18501</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Perrillo</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name><name><surname>Wright</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Rakela</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Levy</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Schiff</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Gish</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Wartin</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Dienstag</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Adams</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Dickson</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Anschuetz</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Bell</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Condreay</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Brown</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><collab>The Lamivudine North American Transplant Group</collab></person-group><article-title>A multicenter United States-Canadian trial to assess lamivudine monotherapy before and after liver transplantation for chronic hepatitis B</article-title><source>Hepatology</source><year>2001</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>424</fpage><lpage>432</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11172345</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1053/jhep.2001.21554</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Andreone</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname